#heading(level: 2)[Recommended First Modded Campaign]

#block[
*Ruler:* Petty King Murchad mac Diarmait of Dublin (1066) \
*Mods enabled:* Bugfixes + UI/HUD + Culture/Religion + Events + Gameplay Mechanics \
*Fantasy/Adult:* Disabled for first run \
*Goal:* Form the Kingdom of Ireland, same as tutorial, but notice how much richer the world feels. \
*Difficulty:* Same as vanilla --- the modlist makes the game deeper, not harder.

*Settings:*
- Game rules: Default (historical)
- Mod rules: Moderate for all configurable mods
- Speed: 3 (slow down and read the new events)
]
